# synstudio effect
name    lumakey
label   Luma key
group   Key
about   Makes the dark part of the picture transparent — for titles shot on
about   black, and for anything you want to screen in rather than lay over
alpha   1
param   threshold  0.1  0  1  Threshold
param   tolerance  0.1  0  1  Tolerance
param   softness   0.0  0  1  Softness
filter  [$in]format=rgba,lumakey=threshold=$threshold:tolerance=$tolerance:
filter  softness=$softness[$out]
